# ---------------- PhysBall.events (physics movement test) ----------------
# Setup: EventSheet on the PhysBall RigidBody, "Use Physics Movement" ON.
# Body: dynamic, EnableGravity ON, solid SphereCollider child, Override Mass = 1.
# Hold T to drive the ball toward the crate; release T to brake it.

when T is held
  move toward PhysCrate speed 200

when T is released
  stop moving
